      <p class="board-description">Followed by a first of its kind summit, a large conference specifically focused on FOSS for the social sector, the first of its kind, was held at BIC Bengaluru on 14 Sep 2022. OASIS governing council and secretariat formed by select members from the original founding organisations became operational, with the secretariat hiring and setting up a full time team with funding from the Samagata Foundation.</p>
